          ]
        }
      },
      "consequence": {
        "kind": "none",
        "exposedClass": "informational",
        "statement": "The new seLinuxOptions value is available for configuration but is not required for environments outside of platforms with SELinux constraints; on platforms like OpenShift that enforce SELinux, setting seLinuxOptions.type to spc_t may be necessary to prevent istio-cni-nodes pod startup failures."
      },
      "statement": "Added value `seLinuxOptions` to istio-cni chart"
